msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D4A207D5_34C3_4503_8EFC_84D4E1870A11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dining hall...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Le réfectoire... ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8F2B740D_2847_41C8_BB0A_628B80A27314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d44496f78fc74a523562efb1e62f8fc49d1964747c6eb086c7e315fa77dca85
#. default-sha256: c8b7bf1309bf751526c7fa7e42cb09f2dbcf5edba550ce338c300412d5d141f3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8F2B740D_2847_41C8_BB0A_628B80A27314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There’s quite the crowd—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫all the people here helping with festival prep—"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫so you should probably hurry if you want to get some."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il y a pas mal de monde —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ ils viennent tous aider pour les préparatifs "
"du festival —⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ alors vous devriez probablement vous dépêcher si vous voulez qu’il en "
"reste."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BEF42CD6_E478_4B9C_840F_05222C5DCC16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d80293ed00385d838e900f5e8aff47b4340f876f623c53323d7091e33ec16709
#. default-sha256: 70aa2e9b897e426a8a30cea424252bfbba6d65a9c2b29c31e65e8e74798210d3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BEF42CD6_E478_4B9C_840F_05222C5DCC16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(My mind’s still waking up...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Mon esprit est encore en train de se réveiller...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C7E8CD0E_A37C_4F74_9BA4_F882B2547D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4760c9589d7cdd856ca85769be443b532391038e06f3abc0563994152d9a6988
#. default-sha256: b0955c1dd53bbfe1353e5abf8dcff3d8d65f0e3ddc889dc5a1baefe6bd55c10d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C7E8CD0E_A37C_4F74_9BA4_F882B2547D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I mentioned yesterday, the heart of the harvest festival is here at the church, "
"but it’s a city-wide event."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Comme je l’ai mentionné hier, le cœur de la fête se déroulera ici, à l’église, "
"même si c’est un événement qui concerne toute la ville."

#: scenario8:scenario8_53575B42_7B18_4E16_8B25_177FB4D8788D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f283897ba5e052c9ab6289270e9f28cbe8e0bd20024503b1a63b794a26d66bb
#. default-sha256: 6194134af0e6bb897bee36bf30c8f084bf05cd60b271125403841709498cf630
