msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That would be the smart thing to do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’est ce qui paraît le plus raisonnable, en effet."

#: scenario8:scenario8_76EA564A_ACAC_47A1_9660_169AE6940A2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f02f6cb19d52372a512b505475424d1fb31cd1755965224ee727dd2d08b571d6
