msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mell. Do you know where I could find the nun?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mell. Sais-tu où se trouve la bonne sœur ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8C48AD16_D741_4098_8BC8_3C515E421164
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 205e70278b9024823f247adccba6f19a5f21a866fc071e696c03881050c4f22d
#. default-sha256: 4ff0c2b42e57c10faedafd9effd524b9489056d6662ea699ec3667a85966b229
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8C48AD16_D741_4098_8BC8_3C515E421164"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her? She should be in the dining hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La nonne ? Elle devrait être au réfectoire."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 489843a4f762b3b0b08155e4f710d0b31f031800bd0cbd3b1d452dde623bec60
#. default-sha256: da0100f9dc5c51f15ba7d150a1c94e8deee18e408f559b7af7e9fc85f4c7b3f0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s when we go up into the tower.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Though even if they were on the "
"property,⟪k:5⟫you wouldn’t be able to just walk up and talk to them.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Especially not the "
"lord."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est là qu’on monte dans la tour.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Mais bon, même s’ils étaient ici,"
"⟪k:5⟫vous ne pourriez pas simplement aller vers eux et leur parler.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Surtout pas le "
"seigneur."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bbf426f555dcd06cbaf00bae62e8f0fd4a7c62eeec244059c5f4d65dbc5221e
#. default-sha256: d8de08e25e85bfb0b5275c7de79b5c148394f5742ec6f13d33f94630831a0c2e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Also, I don’t keep track of where they go or what they do, sorry...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I, ⟪k:4⟫"
"well... ⟪k:5⟫I don’t really ⟪k:6⟫want⟪k:7⟫ to know what they’re up to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Et puis, je ne suis pas au fait de leurs allées et venues ou de ce qu’ils font, "
"désolé...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je, ⟪k:4⟫eh bien... ⟪k:5⟫je n’ai pas tellement ⟪k:6⟫envie⟪k:7⟫ de savoir ce "
"qu’ils fabriquent..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27B9C282_B9A4_4780_803F_602A4C63B24D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd39e159f30c9b924c69a47325fa3757fd3dbf88a574b46ada0b1e0e5596891f
#. default-sha256: fb9bd34bfc50f627a391e93e81647dbb7c4a1ed0080bf9e5cd8c4983fc1f191d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27B9C282_B9A4_4780_803F_602A4C63B24D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That first step is still a big one, though, at least for him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce premier pas est tout de même un grand pas, du moins pour lui."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D6B76B2_FE19_4B42_89FA_6CA963539A69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 946907356047101d9c64fd70f3c9096d3c6fac3a442a29958dd399cb883f46d8
#. default-sha256: 2528301e605231ed8ac450f3121099e41b8dbb2dc8326ceb1364004cad84904d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1D6B76B2_FE19_4B42_89FA_6CA963539A69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I suppose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oui, c’est possible."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8449313A_BEBB_4E43_AB30_486BF6FF69DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6790c0fca31a1fd97366cb1e2e20821cc53594ec3b80b0c02321a4c518cac42
#. default-sha256: 1e9d9023cba49e59e38276412fa31a2373f1325bbfc9210922aab335312a5773
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8449313A_BEBB_4E43_AB30_486BF6FF69DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I’m used to it, so don’t worry about me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais je m’y suis habituée, ne vous en faites pas pour moi !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 043d5de7c6bfe324d67cd7d2f16ff2b18825c9bcff44ea5ed5036f1d3f5529c5
#. default-sha256: ca6d227606bce9eabeaf451433ff0e1cb5c833468d89f54d9778e8e3f7bd610f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Which means, when my eyes are closed, she has no light at all...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Ce qui veut dire que quand je ferme les yeux, elle n’a plus aucune lumière...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d92647606eed59887fc983877cc020ccbc9b28858a40e1d31f85b391768f0833
#. default-sha256: 0638df342e02b4ec40d0db9082078b773d10d3a939b231fc8bbd5fe75e3343ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You won’t have the energy to do anything if you don’t keep yourself well rested "
"and nourished."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous n’aurez plus l’énergie de rien faire si vous ne vous reposez pas et si vous "
"ne vous alimentez pas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c27b40cd4d90c42aca6cff2ea71f260bb1819c243558acc078ff1e96a5c2a81b
#. default-sha256: 40dc14202f9ed96f4010c31e485c2c089e9b1c285c3e57afd9738d47973cf48d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting in the center of the room is a long table, lined with bread and wine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Au milieu de la pièce trône une longue table garnie de pain et de vin."

#: scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0fba97f0d7ae5e2297b6ccf0217c196468a284baafbaa21117b660de0e220ef
#. default-sha256: 00ac641a1983820cfea950c1347693b51d0dc3daaae0952b60af0c18a4e85d63
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The majority of people in the room look poor, like they genuinely need the assistance, but "
"there are a handful of those who look more than well off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La majeure partie d’entre eux ont l’air pauvres et semblent vraiment avoir besoin de cette "
"aide, mais il y a aussi une poignée de personnes qui paraissent très bien s’en sortir."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2074b4b821f23f1eafeb56470427a14a73a4b3ad49e794baae7e92c25e0778e
#. default-sha256: 3e57b16b4ac8f9ee34ca91a6311f5d2a5a283da7f5dec4cd3a57924bcc794d01
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They don’t seem to be for want of supplies at the moment, though. ⟪k:3⟫I assume "
"that’s thanks to the lord’s patronage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais ils n’ont pas l’air d’être en manque de vivres pour le moment. ⟪k:3⟫C’est "
"grâce à la protection du seigneur, j’imagine."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6352875708fc04eab1fe87057bd40c3d7ceafc8875609003429e4722632c54de
#. default-sha256: fe7b791e9975cfab1cd50791830f83c919f0af477a6c489167af08de5905e9e4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Give it a rest already, young man!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Can’tcha see, she ain’t interested!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Laisse tomber, jeune homme !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tu vois pas, elle est pas intéressée !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6c9e107fecc2675cba87b01798652b5111f2d0fdb9211ed03c2b88ffd195375
#. default-sha256: 32fd6d46173c0d983e7efa906eae050231c84a367c0ac9d5fe9e45b1b9347036
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ah, ⟪k:4⟫wait—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Qu— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ah, ⟪k:4⟫attendez—!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 892b2faeb035da08cce55c7e05dbf02a01cb1ee3a7c8c79963c78666c1c736a2
#. default-sha256: 2be27c07ca169f1c90ea17212e11b3266f7ff624a906af9491a7e2c397400c2f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Of course, our Saintess!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pick it up, young man!⟪k:5⟫Ya need some time "
"outside ta cool off!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bien sûr, vénérée Sainte !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Reprends-toi, jeune homme !⟪k:5⟫T’as besoin de "
"passer un peu de temps dehors, ça te remettra les idées en place !"

